(Source:                 Fraunhofer IIS) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 731.24 Tm
/F9 10.0 Tf
(Title:   ) Tj
/F6 12.0 Tf
(                 ATIAS Contents) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 707.36 Tm
/F9 10.0 Tf
(Document for:     ) Tj
/F6 12.0 Tf
(     Discussion and Agreement) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 683.48 Tm
/F9 10.0 Tf
(Agenda Item: ) Tj
/F6 12.0 Tf
(     Unique) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 628.28 Tm
/F9 10.0 Tf
(Summary) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 594.48 Tm
(This contribution aims at triggering a discussion on the contents for the two specifications 26.261 \(requirements\) and) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 582.08 Tm
(26.260 \(objective test methods\) targeted by ATIAS. The general presentation scheme is to provide sections \(with) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 569.68 Tm
(content, where applicable, or just the heading\) following the structure of 26.131/132 merged to a single document,) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 557.28 Tm
(regardless of later on distribution over several specifications.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 532.48 Tm
(Section W contains a proposal on \224Interfaces\225 that could go to section 4 of the draft TS 26.261. The text has been) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 520.08 Tm
(derived from TS 26.132 and adapted for access technologies of relevance for immersive audio services plus an) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 507.68 Tm
(editor\221s note to discuss the potential acoustic interfaces.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 482.88 Tm
(Section X contains a proposal on \224Performance for conversational services\225 that could go to section 5 of the draft TS) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 470.48 Tm
(26.261. It is proposed to discuss the test cases copied from TS 26.131 for their applicability to immersive) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 458.08 Tm
(conversational services. It should be noted that the list may not be exhaustive for immersive conversational services) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 445.68 Tm
(with new challenges imposed by spatial audio capturing and playback.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 420.88 Tm
(Section Y contains a proposal on \224Test Configurations\225 that could go to a draft CR to 26.260. Some common sections) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 408.48 Tm
(in 26.132 seem to be still applicable, with minor edits required. Editor\221s notes are inserted at places where a) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 396.08 Tm
(discussion is required how to derive the test configurations while IVAS is not yet finalized.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 371.28 Tm
(Section Z contains a proposal on \224Test Methods\225 that could go to a draft CR to 26.260. The list should essentially) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 358.88 Tm
(mirror the performance requirements section in terms of structure, thus the same discussion applies.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 321.68 Tm
(In summary, the source proposes to discuss the contents of this contribution as potential contents for the ATIAS-) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 309.28 Tm
(affected specifications. If there can be consensus derived on certain aspects, it is furthermore proposed to move) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 296.88 Tm
(agreeable contents to the draft TS 26.261 or a new draftCR for TS26.260. A potential alternative is to start a) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 284.48 Tm
(permanent document, which would be later on used for input to the TS and CR26.260.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 247.28 Tm
(This contribution is a revision of S4-AHQ144, which has been presented at an SQ conference call. Given that there) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 234.88 Tm
(was good feedback and a good discussion but no concrete proposals for change, the document is resubmitted.) Tj
ET
endstream
