(For LTE connections, the system simulator shall be configured for FDD operation, with a default or dedicated bearer) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 745.20 Tm
(and reference measurement channel scheduling that provides enough resource block allocation for transmitting a full) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 732.80 Tm
(speech packet within a transmission time interval of 1ms. No HARQ re-transmissions shall occur. TDD operation,) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 720.40 Tm
(TTI bundling, connected DRX and other forms of scheduling \(e.g. SPS\) are for further study.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 699.00 Tm
(The test setup has to ensure proper clock synchronization of the test equipment to the UE. Clock skew shall be) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 686.60 Tm
(negligible and packet loss shall not occur during the test.) Tj
